  "comment": [
    "Every revision whose anchored comments must still be in the release head, for tools/release/test-marker-guard.ps1.",
    "A revision is named by its commit, not by its branch: a branch another workflow deletes would take the gate",
    "with it, and the commit is what was actually merged. Add a row in the commit that merges a wagon into the train.",
    "A release built from a tree that does not have one of these commits cannot run the gate, so it fails: fetch the",
    "commits or state in the release's own record why a source is unreachable."
